WEBVTT

00:45.933 --> 00:48.128
Don't you want to die,
Sakuya Kira?

00:48.936 --> 00:51.632
If you could keep on living,
what you would like to do?

00:52.940 --> 00:54.805
I would read.

00:54.909 --> 00:58.504
I would study a lot and
understand the world.

00:58.612 --> 01:01.103
Then, how about making
a deal with me?

01:01.282 --> 01:04.115
In the next few years
as I try to accomplish my goal,

01:04.218 --> 01:06.209
I'd like to borrow your body.

01:06.620 --> 01:09.088
In exchange, I'll grant you
all your wishes.

01:09.557 --> 01:12.583
But I'll eventually die again,
will I?

01:12.693 --> 01:15.025
My mother's dead, and soon
I'll die, too.

01:15.129 --> 01:18.394
My father will have to grieve
twice.

01:18.766 --> 01:22.725
Will you promise me then?
Make my father hate me.

01:23.371 --> 01:25.703
When the deal is over
and I'm dead,

01:25.806 --> 01:27.933
I don't want my father
to be sad.

01:28.175 --> 01:30.302
I want to be positively
unlovable to my father.

01:33.114 --> 01:35.241
When will you ever
understand, Sakuya?

01:35.516 --> 01:37.848
How I've struggled to cope
all this time.

01:38.018 --> 01:40.953
Can't you see you're all
I have left?

01:41.422 --> 01:45.290
I don't get you.
Why don't you cut me off?

01:46.026 --> 01:48.085
Drinking, smoking
and womanizing...

01:48.362 --> 01:51.354
My devious behavior was meant to
deflect your affection.

01:51.699 --> 01:54.259
But ever since I merged
with this being,

01:54.368 --> 01:56.859
certain new feelings have sprung
up inside me.

01:57.004 --> 01:59.302
What are you talking about,
Sakuya?

01:59.440 --> 02:02.637
Why can't you understand?
I'm not your Sakuya.

02:02.910 --> 02:05.743
Sakuya Kira died
eleven years ago.

02:06.247 --> 02:07.680
What the hell are you doing?

02:08.516 --> 02:10.040
Let's have that wound treated.

02:11.485 --> 02:12.816
What wound?

02:13.154 --> 02:15.315
Where do you see a wound?

02:15.956 --> 02:19.414
Do you get it now?
I'm not your son.

02:20.127 --> 02:21.822
I'm a freak.

02:26.200 --> 02:28.498
Did you say you were going
to Hokkaido on business?

02:28.602 --> 02:29.626
Beat it then.

02:30.237 --> 02:33.570
I don't ever wanna see your mug
again. Get me out of your mind.

02:34.975 --> 02:36.533
Sakuya...

02:37.611 --> 02:40.444
Please don't deprive me anymore.

02:42.149 --> 02:45.414
This is the only way I know.

02:46.153 --> 02:49.247
Forget me as soon as possible
and start a new life.

02:50.524 --> 02:54.426
So long, my ex-father.

02:55.963 --> 02:57.521
Say, Sakuya.

02:59.733 --> 03:01.200
Do you love Dad?

03:02.403 --> 03:03.301
I do.

03:03.637 --> 03:04.831
And Setsuna, too?

03:08.275 --> 03:09.264
I guess.

03:10.744 --> 03:13.907
I liked this silly world.

03:14.181 --> 03:16.445
I guess I actually did enjoy
every moment of it.

03:17.051 --> 03:20.680
You know what?
You've become a human being.

03:24.592 --> 03:25.889
I guess.

03:51.552 --> 03:53.247
We're not fooling ourselves.

03:54.855 --> 03:57.517
We know our happiness won't
last forever.

03:58.959 --> 04:02.292
But for now...
just for the time being,

04:02.396 --> 04:04.455
let us indulge in our role
as a happy couple.

04:04.798 --> 04:05.856
Is it me?

04:06.000 --> 04:09.197
If we were to kneel before God,
we'd surely be found guilty.

04:11.705 --> 04:14.765
The happiest sinners on earth.

04:16.277 --> 04:17.767
Wait, Setsuna.

04:18.379 --> 04:22.406
I can't. If I wait any longer,
I'll turn into a fossil.

04:23.484 --> 04:26.783
It is like a sacred ritual.

04:26.887 --> 04:30.448
Tremendously terrifying
and unbearably bittersweet...

04:30.591 --> 04:34.425
Then why does it fill me
with such happiness?

04:37.865 --> 04:42.302
God... Please forsake us.

04:43.537 --> 04:44.333
I beg you.

04:45.906 --> 04:48.466
Stop.
Stop it, sister.

04:49.610 --> 04:50.577
Why?

04:51.045 --> 04:53.570
Sister, why do you
torture me so?

04:54.882 --> 04:56.247
Dear sister, Alexiel...

04:56.817 --> 04:58.375
Something must be done,

04:58.485 --> 05:01.886
or Sir Rosiel will be starved
for her affection and then...

05:03.057 --> 05:04.615
There can be
no avoiding it now.

05:05.059 --> 05:06.526
Even if we both end up dead,

05:06.627 --> 05:09.187
I'll deal with Setsuna Mudo
myself.

05:23.277 --> 05:26.678
There were no Japanese
passengers on board.

05:27.047 --> 05:27.945
Our next story.

05:28.082 --> 05:30.744
The 18-year-old youth who was
arrested for threatening...

05:30.851 --> 05:34.878
...policemen with a Japanese
sword recently...

05:35.189 --> 05:38.784
...has confessed to the murder of
a high school student...

05:38.892 --> 05:41.122
...which occurred earlier in Tokyo.

05:43.030 --> 05:47.194
The youth and the victim had
been members of a gang.

05:47.334 --> 05:50.132
The police are looking into
the possibility that...

05:50.237 --> 05:54.765
...a petty altercation may have
led to this murder.

05:57.111 --> 05:57.873
Setsuna?

05:57.978 --> 06:00.242
Kira is taking the blame for me.

06:00.347 --> 06:01.143
What?

06:01.882 --> 06:02.814
Setsuna?

06:07.254 --> 06:10.052
Sara, listen carefully.

06:10.958 --> 06:13.483
I've killed a man.

06:13.627 --> 06:14.559
What?

06:14.828 --> 06:16.489
I know it's hard to believe,

06:16.597 --> 06:19.498
but there is this being inside
me, an independent entity.

06:19.600 --> 06:22.125
And Kato, the guy I killed,
had one inside him, too.

06:22.236 --> 06:25.262
The other me was trying to
save Kato from this being.

06:25.839 --> 06:28.672
But I did commit the murder,
with my own hands.

06:28.842 --> 06:31.140
And the cops who followed you
to the airport?

06:31.278 --> 06:32.336
They were looking for me.

06:32.479 --> 06:35.414
No way. I don't want to be
without you anymore.

06:35.549 --> 06:36.982
Neither do I, but...

06:37.618 --> 06:39.449
Kira is sacrificing
himself for me.

06:40.120 --> 06:41.815
And here I am,
totally oblivious...

06:50.097 --> 06:52.998
Setsuna.
Let's go back to Tokyo.

06:53.133 --> 06:54.122
Are you sure, Sara?

06:54.468 --> 06:57.369
Watch me, I'm going
to protect you.

06:57.504 --> 07:00.337
Just as you've protected me
all my life,

07:00.441 --> 07:03.035
it's my turn to protect you.

07:03.510 --> 07:04.374
Sara.

07:04.878 --> 07:07.904
Girls have white wings...

07:09.049 --> 07:11.415
...the wings with which to
protect their loved ones.

07:11.785 --> 07:15.050
I'm going to embrace you
with those wings.

07:15.189 --> 07:18.556
The penalty program by which
heaven incarcerated Alexiel...

07:18.659 --> 07:19.751
...is about to be corrupted.

07:19.860 --> 07:22.385
His human name is Sakuya Kira.

07:22.496 --> 07:25.761
He has interfered with
Alexiel's destiny.

07:25.866 --> 07:26.833
As a result,

07:26.934 --> 07:29.903
on this day Tokyo will vanish
off the face of the earth,

07:30.471 --> 07:33.565
and Setsuna Mudo will meet
inevitable death.

07:36.043 --> 07:38.568
Setsuna... Setsuna will die?

07:39.179 --> 07:42.239
Where are you?
Tell me where you are, Setsuna.

08:01.335 --> 08:05.362
It's all right.
We'll never be apart.

08:05.472 --> 08:07.963
As long as we're alive,
we'll meet again.

08:09.009 --> 08:10.033
Sure.

08:21.922 --> 08:22.946
Where are we?

08:33.801 --> 08:36.929
You did nothing wrong.
Even so...

08:39.139 --> 08:41.300
Your existence is too much
of a threat in itself.

08:41.441 --> 08:42.806
Duck, Sara.

08:44.244 --> 08:45.438
Shit.

08:45.746 --> 08:46.644
Setsuna.

09:06.233 --> 09:11.000
The ring you gave me
protected us...

09:13.207 --> 09:16.176
This is for the one whom
I respect and love,

09:16.276 --> 09:19.643
the one who gave me, a mere grigore,
the lowest celestial being,

09:19.746 --> 09:22.340
a new life as a cherub.
This is for Sir Rosiel.

09:22.583 --> 09:24.073
Disappear, Setsuna Mudo.

09:24.218 --> 09:25.310
He's an angel?

09:26.920 --> 09:27.852
Setsuna!

09:44.638 --> 09:45.696
Sara.

09:50.043 --> 09:52.671
Do you have any pain, Sara?

09:55.282 --> 09:56.681
Big brother...

09:59.853 --> 10:02.549
It hurts. It's very painful.

10:02.756 --> 10:04.883
I'm scared, big brother.

10:05.525 --> 10:07.720
What have I done?

10:08.395 --> 10:12.229
Oh, no... I broke the ring.

10:12.332 --> 10:15.062
This is the ring you gave me.

10:15.469 --> 10:16.731
I'm sorry.

10:17.304 --> 10:23.402
I'm hopeless. Do you think
a klutz like me can be happy?

10:23.844 --> 10:25.471
...happy...

10:30.484 --> 10:31.451
Sara?

10:34.021 --> 10:35.113
This isn't happening.

10:35.889 --> 10:38.255
Come on, open your eyes.

10:38.358 --> 10:41.088
Damn it, don't fool around.
Wake up, I said!

10:41.728 --> 10:42.695
Sara.

10:42.829 --> 10:47.129
It's all right.
We'll never be apart.

10:47.567 --> 10:50.661
As long as we're alive,
we'll meet again.

10:51.104 --> 10:52.594
As long as we're alive...

10:52.906 --> 10:55.272
Wake up, Sara.

10:58.245 --> 10:59.405
Why?

11:01.448 --> 11:02.437
Why?

11:02.683 --> 11:04.878
That's the third wing,

11:04.985 --> 11:07.920
the source of energy
for Organic Angel Alexiel.

11:08.322 --> 11:11.883
Have I initiated
the resurrection of Alexiel?

11:17.597 --> 11:18.928
Rosiel.

11:31.845 --> 11:34.678
What is that tremendous mass
of energy?

11:48.028 --> 11:51.759
I guess you have no use for
a world without Sara.

11:51.865 --> 11:52.832
Right, Setsuna?

11:59.239 --> 12:00.171
Setsuna.

12:00.407 --> 12:03.570
You wanna kill me?
Wanna kill the world?

12:09.116 --> 12:14.554
At last. I've been waiting for
you, my dear sister, Alexiel.

12:17.024 --> 12:21.120
I hope Father left Tokyo
as planned.

12:23.463 --> 12:25.727
He found out who I am.

12:26.566 --> 12:29.057
Not to worry, there's no way
he'll stick around...

12:31.938 --> 12:33.200
Father?

12:34.741 --> 12:37.232
Sakuya, you're all right.

12:37.677 --> 12:42.205
Father... You dumb old man.
Why didn't you go to Hokkaido?

12:42.349 --> 12:43.907
You, the workaholic,
of all people.

12:44.518 --> 12:47.544
I went all right.
But I turned back on the way.

12:47.654 --> 12:49.053
I had a premonition.

12:49.156 --> 12:52.557
I felt that if I left just then,
I wouldn't see my son again.

12:52.692 --> 12:54.717
You still consider me your son?

12:54.861 --> 12:59.059
That's right. You're my precious
son who stuck it out with me...

12:59.166 --> 13:01.293
...for the last eleven years.

13:01.401 --> 13:03.494
No matter how much you rebelled,

13:03.603 --> 13:06.663
I could see the pain
in your eyes.

13:07.274 --> 13:10.072
I always knew.

13:10.577 --> 13:13.637
You were crying out for my help
all along, weren't you?

13:14.114 --> 13:18.881
It's true. I was always
in a lot of pain,

13:19.052 --> 13:23.819
unaware of my love for people
and of the agony of my deceit.

13:23.990 --> 13:25.855
That's enough, Sakuya.

13:26.326 --> 13:27.850
I didn't even know...

13:27.961 --> 13:31.863
...how much I yearned to
become a human being.

13:32.332 --> 13:33.230
Sakuya.

13:33.366 --> 13:34.993
Be quiet. Shut up for a second.

13:35.102 --> 13:37.127
I'm glad I saw you.

13:37.270 --> 13:40.000
Father? No.
Don't close your eyes.

13:40.640 --> 13:44.474
Setsuna, are you going to
watch us die like this?

13:44.611 --> 13:46.875
Wake up, Setsuna.

13:47.781 --> 13:50.443
Who's calling me?

13:51.651 --> 13:55.815
Don't bother. I don't want
a world without Sara.

13:58.291 --> 13:59.189
Sara?

14:03.163 --> 14:04.596
Who are you calling Sara?

14:05.465 --> 14:07.558
Kira. Where am I?

14:07.834 --> 14:08.994
What is this?

14:09.102 --> 14:11.229
You asked for help in math
for your make-up test,

14:11.338 --> 14:13.898
so I skipped a student council
meeting to coach you.

14:14.307 --> 14:16.775
You have some nerve
snoozing on me, Mudo.

14:17.477 --> 14:18.842
You were groaning quite a bit.

14:18.945 --> 14:20.503
Were you having a nightmare
or something?

14:21.047 --> 14:21.979
A nightmare?

14:22.949 --> 14:24.576
Perfect timing.

14:24.684 --> 14:26.982
Mudo was calling out your name
in his sleep.

14:27.087 --> 14:28.019
Can't be.

14:28.588 --> 14:31.148
Were you being lazy again,
Setsuna?

14:31.291 --> 14:34.454
No way.
My kid sister Sara got...

14:35.529 --> 14:37.895
How am I your kid sister?

14:37.998 --> 14:40.262
We've been seeing each other
for six months,

14:40.367 --> 14:41.891
and that's how you think of me?

14:42.002 --> 14:44.766
Or, are you still dreaming?

14:44.871 --> 14:45.496
Dreaming?

14:45.972 --> 14:47.098
Hey, Kato.

14:47.974 --> 14:49.601
You dropped this. Catch.

14:49.709 --> 14:52.109
You should stop dealing drugs
during class.

14:52.245 --> 14:54.179
Not so loud.

14:54.281 --> 14:56.112
It's none of your business.

14:58.251 --> 15:00.378
They're alive.

15:01.521 --> 15:05.548
I hate the classics teacher.
He's got a thing against me.

15:05.692 --> 15:08.456
Was it all a dream?

15:09.362 --> 15:11.956
They're all alive,
and Sara is not my sister.

15:13.466 --> 15:15.263
There are no angels or demons.

15:15.368 --> 15:17.199
I'm an ordinary high school
student.

15:17.571 --> 15:20.540
This is the reality.

15:21.541 --> 15:23.600
There are no such things
as angels and demons.

15:26.780 --> 15:29.248
What's going on with you?

15:29.382 --> 15:30.178
Well, nothing.

15:30.483 --> 15:32.747
If you don't feel like it,
that's okay.

15:32.852 --> 15:34.911
I'll go see it by myself.

15:43.496 --> 15:44.656
Don't go.

15:46.233 --> 15:48.428
I don't ever want to be
without you again.

15:48.768 --> 15:49.666
Setsuna?

15:49.869 --> 15:51.837
I had a long and sad dream.

15:52.205 --> 15:56.005
You had to endure so much pain
and so much suffering, and...

15:56.676 --> 15:58.701
The last scene was so sad.

16:00.780 --> 16:03.715
It's all right.
All that was a bad dream.

16:04.017 --> 16:05.814
The nightmare is over.

16:11.258 --> 16:12.520
That ring.

16:12.826 --> 16:16.318
What about it? It's the first
ring you bought me.

16:16.529 --> 16:20.329
Look, it's a genuine ruby,
hard to break.

16:20.767 --> 16:22.029
Isn't it lovely?

16:24.771 --> 16:28.764
That's not it.
That's not the ring I gave you.

16:29.142 --> 16:33.078
That ring got smashed and...

16:33.647 --> 16:34.443
Don't say it.

16:34.781 --> 16:37.215
If you don't say it,
you can stay here for good.

16:37.984 --> 16:39.542
I want to be here, too.

16:39.886 --> 16:42.150
I want to stay here
with you forever.

16:42.289 --> 16:46.521
Let's. Let's stay here together
and think of happy thoughts.

16:49.129 --> 16:52.223
I would be so happy,
if I could do that.

16:52.399 --> 16:55.562
But someone is calling me
because...

16:55.835 --> 16:58.861
Don't say it, Setsuna.
Please don't.

16:59.306 --> 17:01.467
Because this world isn't real.

17:02.409 --> 17:04.309
You're not the real Sara either.

17:05.178 --> 17:09.342
You're a replica created
by my fantasy.

17:17.857 --> 17:19.586
In spite of that knowledge,

17:21.328 --> 17:23.626
I still would've liked to
stay here. But...

17:24.297 --> 17:26.288
I must fight.

17:33.773 --> 17:35.001
Setsuna.

17:35.975 --> 17:39.502
I can't stop bleeding.
Am I going to die?

17:40.513 --> 17:43.243
Who would've thought
I'm capable of dying?

17:43.416 --> 17:46.112
Hold it. You're taking the easy
way out while we suffer?

17:46.853 --> 17:50.550
You called me, so I came out
of my dream.

17:50.824 --> 17:51.791
Setsuna.

17:54.894 --> 17:56.953
Setsuna, where are you?

17:59.866 --> 18:02.027
There he is. He is alive.

18:06.206 --> 18:07.639
Setsuna!!

18:09.209 --> 18:10.107
Sara...

18:10.243 --> 18:11.733
How did this happen?

18:12.479 --> 18:15.778
This is not the outcome
I had in mind.

18:16.549 --> 18:19.382
All I wanted was to be able
to see her smile.

18:20.120 --> 18:21.314
Sets...(choke)

18:22.389 --> 18:23.253
Kira.

18:23.790 --> 18:25.018
You got a serious injury.

18:25.392 --> 18:29.328
Shoot. I busted this up,
and it's affecting you.

18:30.063 --> 18:32.190
Setsuna, you know who I am?

18:32.332 --> 18:33.424
I remember now.

18:33.733 --> 18:35.200
I'm sorry.
I'll fix it right away.

18:36.302 --> 18:38.736
I hope you know
what you're doing.

18:39.672 --> 18:40.536
Rosiel.

18:41.074 --> 18:42.666
That man willingly sought blood...

18:42.776 --> 18:45.711
...and victimized tens of
thousands of souls.

18:45.812 --> 18:49.304
He is the magic sword that
inherited my regenerative power...

18:49.416 --> 18:50.815
...when he sealed me with a spell.

18:51.351 --> 18:53.342
He is the seven-bladed sword
of the Holy Spirit.

18:53.553 --> 18:55.111
Kira is Seven Blades?

18:55.255 --> 18:57.120
I remembered that already.

18:57.257 --> 18:58.747
Then I'll get right to
the point.

18:59.292 --> 19:01.624
Setsuna Mudo, or rather,
Alexiel...

19:01.928 --> 19:05.864
Send him into oblivion
with your own hands.

19:07.500 --> 19:09.331
What are you talking about?
Why do I...

19:09.469 --> 19:14.236
You seem to think all the fault
rests with me, but you're wrong.

19:14.574 --> 19:17.543
For if Seven Blades had not
interfered with your destiny,

19:17.644 --> 19:21.239
my sister's awakening would not
have been possible.

19:21.347 --> 19:24.783
And now Tokyo has collapsed
and Sara Mudo is dead.

19:24.884 --> 19:27.216
Everything happened as
a consequence of his exploits.

19:27.687 --> 19:31.714
All this was part of a scripted
mayhem designed to induce...

19:31.825 --> 19:33.019
Alexiel's awakening.

19:33.359 --> 19:36.192
He masterminded it so as to
satisfy his thirst for blood.

19:36.996 --> 19:38.429
Kill me, Setsuna.

19:39.299 --> 19:43.258
It's time I turned over the old
man and this body to Sakuya.

19:43.369 --> 19:47.635
Indeed, he pretends to be a man,
but he's not.

19:47.874 --> 19:50.502
He beckons disasters. He is
an embodiment of wicked intent.

19:50.610 --> 19:53.943
In his never-ending quest for
blood, he kept at your side,

19:54.047 --> 19:56.914
reveling in every misfortune
that fell on you.

19:57.050 --> 20:00.850
Don't you detest him?
He's been exploiting you.

20:01.087 --> 20:01.951
Setsuna.

20:02.088 --> 20:04.022
Go ahead. Kill him.

20:04.123 --> 20:05.249
It's easy enough,

20:05.358 --> 20:07.918
now that you possess the power
of the three wings.

20:08.561 --> 20:10.358
Go on, quick.

20:15.668 --> 20:18.068
In the sixteen years
of living in this world,

20:18.438 --> 20:21.134
I've had many things happen
to me, both painful and sad...

20:21.241 --> 20:24.301
But they were not disasters.

20:25.578 --> 20:28.809
I saw you in my dream, Kira,
but it was someone else.

20:29.449 --> 20:32.009
The only Kira I know is you.

20:32.118 --> 20:35.315
I'll believe only the truths
within me.

20:47.534 --> 20:50.833
Sister, you're going to kill me
after all.

20:51.204 --> 20:53.263
But I swear I'll...

21:01.681 --> 21:03.774
Setsuna, you did it.

21:06.452 --> 21:07.680
Is it over?

21:19.699 --> 21:21.530
What was that?

21:26.506 --> 21:29.703
Tokyo has been restored?

21:31.077 --> 21:33.341
What's going on?

21:37.517 --> 21:39.508
You helped me once before.

21:40.086 --> 21:41.519
I am Seraphita.

21:41.721 --> 21:44.519
Seraphita...
I've heard about you.

21:44.624 --> 21:46.649
You're the highest celestial
being God created.

21:46.859 --> 21:50.260
You're the only Adam-Kadamon
who can manipulate time magic.

21:50.463 --> 21:51.225
Indeed.

21:51.531 --> 21:55.194
I reverted the flow of time
and froze it just moments...

21:55.301 --> 21:57.201
...before the catastrophe.

21:58.004 --> 22:00.097
To make it seem as if
nothing had happened.

22:02.275 --> 22:03.264
Father.

22:03.443 --> 22:06.901
If you can reverse everything,
why didn't Sara revive?

22:07.413 --> 22:10.712
Why didn't you revert the time
to before she died?

22:11.618 --> 22:13.813
Because her death is necessary.

22:14.153 --> 22:15.279
Necessary?

22:15.588 --> 22:18.716
For the longest time,
we waited for this occasion,

22:18.825 --> 22:21.760
for your birth, that is,
the birth of a savior angel.

22:21.861 --> 22:25.388
Without her death,
your awakening was not possible.

22:25.531 --> 22:27.294
What does that mean?

22:27.433 --> 22:30.231
Setsuna Mudo,
I need you to save me.

22:30.403 --> 22:32.200
I am an apparition of my spirit.

22:32.305 --> 22:35.968
I am confined in Etemenanch
in the sacred realm.

22:36.242 --> 22:39.234
The only one who can save me
is you, Setsuna Mudo.

22:39.345 --> 22:42.439
For you're the incarnation of
Organic Angel Alexiel.

22:42.982 --> 22:47.419
You must deliver me before God
realizes my transgression.

22:47.520 --> 22:51.422
Otherwise this world, this
material realm, will vanish.

22:52.291 --> 22:55.783
The world will disappear?

23:05.038 --> 23:06.903
Look, Adam-Kadamon.

23:07.440 --> 23:09.704
Where is Sara's soul right now?

23:09.942 --> 23:12.206
In Hades, the land of the dead.

23:12.345 --> 23:15.872
Well, I'm going down there
to look for Sara.

23:15.982 --> 23:19.179
If you tell me how to do that,
I'll do as you wish.

23:21.254 --> 23:22.221
You see,

23:23.122 --> 23:26.888
I'm not as smart as Alexiel,
so I don't know when to give up.

23:27.794 --> 23:31.594
The world I want to save is
the one that has Sara, Kira,

23:31.698 --> 23:34.428
and all the people that
lend me support.

23:34.867 --> 23:37.461
If I'm the true savior angel,

23:37.570 --> 23:40.937
I will never neglect my beloved
friends and sweethearts.

23:41.040 --> 23:42.268
Don't you agree?

23:42.375 --> 23:44.400
Don't be ridiculous.

23:44.510 --> 23:47.240
That's not going to bring Sara
back to life.

23:47.380 --> 23:49.348
You don't know till I try.

23:49.482 --> 23:50.813
I know, you crazy dope.

23:51.050 --> 23:54.713
Think of yourself
before you do anybody else.

23:54.821 --> 23:57.255
I mean, really.
Are you stupid or what?

23:57.356 --> 23:59.916
You're a good, kindhearted kid.

24:00.259 --> 24:00.918
Setsuna.

24:01.160 --> 24:02.889
Don't you know by now, Kurai?

24:03.296 --> 24:05.423
You can punch me and kick me,

24:05.531 --> 24:07.465
but you'll never make
this pig-head break a promise.

24:07.567 --> 24:10.365
I believe that if you got guts,
nothing's impossible.

24:10.503 --> 24:12.164
That's me, a genuine dope.

24:12.305 --> 24:16.765
You dope! You're the biggest
dope in the whole world.

24:23.616 --> 24:24.776
Seven Blades.

24:25.218 --> 24:28.517
Go on and pierce through
your own master's heart.

24:28.921 --> 24:32.755
That will allow Setsuna's soul
to go to Hades.

24:32.892 --> 24:34.689
Please, Kira.

24:35.261 --> 24:37.559
I promise to come back
with Sara.

24:37.663 --> 24:40.632
The showdown with those rotten
angels will have to wait.

24:40.733 --> 24:44.191
I ain't searching all around
for you again.

24:53.813 --> 24:56.805
You just might have
what it takes.

24:57.850 --> 25:01.877
Perhaps you can accomplish
what Alexiel could not.

25:03.990 --> 25:07.824
Countless challenges lie
ahead of you.

25:08.427 --> 25:12.488
There, seek out absolute truths.
Find faithful disciples.

25:12.598 --> 25:14.657
And be the true king.

25:20.339 --> 25:21.306
Kurai.

25:22.742 --> 25:24.107
Is he dead?

25:24.243 --> 25:27.178
He's off to the nether world
to bring back his wife,

25:27.847 --> 25:30.008
as Orpheus once did.

25:30.416 --> 25:34.352
All we can do now is wait,
and have faith in Setsuna.

25:35.254 --> 25:39.384
I guess so. Only Lord knows
what lies ahead, as they say.

25:39.492 --> 25:41.926
But then again, He can be
surprisingly goofy.

25:42.061 --> 25:43.221
Let us be defiant.

25:43.329 --> 25:45.797
Yo, God.

25:45.898 --> 25:47.695
You just wait till
Setsuna comes back.

25:47.800 --> 25:51.566
Watch what happens when you
make a bunch of dopes angry.

25:51.671 --> 25:54.504
Go on and laugh at those who
challenge destiny.

25:55.174 --> 25:56.698
Let's kill each other.

25:57.109 --> 26:01.068
We'll put up a futile struggle,
howling and shedding blood.

26:01.180 --> 26:04.911
Only then will our genesis
unfold.

26:30.576 --> 26:35.240
Tracing your wound with my lips,

26:36.449 --> 26:40.283
I'm plunged by a piece of
a broken dream.

26:42.488 --> 26:46.754
The knife of romance
concealed deep within

26:48.394 --> 26:52.125
is pressed against
my half-formed skin.

26:54.600 --> 26:59.902
The night is without
consolation.

27:00.640 --> 27:05.475
I want you to rip it apart
with your kiss.

27:06.612 --> 27:11.948
You are the last romanticist left.

27:12.151 --> 27:13.277
Slice it up.

27:13.552 --> 27:19.252
To the bottom of my heart...
darling.

27:19.425 --> 27:23.794
I want my heart broken
each time I fall in love

27:24.030 --> 27:29.525
to discover
the afterimage of angels.

27:51.991 --> 27:54.983
Katan, the only thing of beauty...

27:55.094 --> 27:58.188
...to come out of God's refuse
that I am.

27:59.465 --> 28:03.424
You can't die.
You can't desert me.

28:03.970 --> 28:06.598
I won't allow it, Katan.

28:06.739 --> 28:08.673
Sir Rosiel.

28:10.409 --> 28:13.139
Sevi, I'm frightened.

28:13.245 --> 28:17.944
He's coming. He's coming to
kill me once and for all.
